Partial Solution: I link each investor to their transactions through the shared investor id I group the joined rows by investor so each group represents that investor's transactions I rank the investor groups by their transaction counts in descending order: `FROM INVESTORS AS T1 JOIN TRANSACTIONS AS T2 ON T1.investor_id = T2.investor_id GROUP BY T2.investor_id ORDER BY COUNT(*) DESC`.

